# recorded site responses. Open allflame_exp_001, Ctrl+I, type the account name, Start
# (get-characters, the profile page: "Tester-1234" -> "Tester#1234", the league and character
# dropdowns, the account history), "Passive Tree and Jewels" (the build has a tree: the confirm
# popup, RETURN; get-passive-skills: tattoos, masteries, cluster jewels, the bloodline, bandit and
# pantheons), then "Items and Skills" (get-items: deletes the equipment and skills, imports the
# items and their socketed gems), with a snapshot after each stage.
